<p>One idea that popped into my mind, after the attack reminded me of some spell in Lovecraft's mythos (you mail-order the book from the cult of some hideous Great Old One, and get a spell, which, when performed, allows you to project yourself to any point in the world, with the caveat that anyone present will have their heads ripped off). Everyone gets eaten, <em>except</em> for the bonded person, and the cloud optionally chooses another bond target.<br />
